<h2 class="h4 fw-bold">Summary</h2>
<p class="mb-0">You have completed the <strong>JAR and WAR Artifacts</strong> lesson. Mastering local artifact storage mechanics paves the way for orchestrating front-end pipelines and distributed modern architectures like Node.js and React environments.</p>
</div>


